Add the online gate and the Pages status helper

scripts/check_online.py asks the deployed site the two questions that matter
and cannot be answered from dist/: is the robots header actually served, and
does every canonical point at apocalab.com rather than at pages.dev. It also
covers robots.txt, sitemap.xml and the .geojson MIME type, and bypasses the
system proxy so a proxy cache cannot answer for the origin.

scripts/cf_pages_status.py prints the last few Pages deployments and their
stages (account id comes from CF_ACCOUNT_ID, not from the repository).

README: the project is now live on Cloudflare Pages — apocalab.pages.dev for
production (branch main, no robots header) and preview.apocalab.pages.dev for
the preview build (branch preview, noindex).
